      "versionNonce": 1319635699,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Leading with the newest cohort reports CENSORING as\nperformance. That cohort reads 60.3% only because a quarter of\nit has not finished its 30-day window. The first version of\nthis tile did exactly that and made a healthy launch look like\na failing one.",
      "originalText": "Leading with the newest cohort reports CENSORING as\nperformance. That cohort reads 60.3% only because a quarter of\nit has not finished its 30-day window. The first version of\nthis tile did exactly that and made a healthy launch look like\na failing one.",
