      "text": "Five series by signup week -- digital_activation_rate_7d,\nkit_sla_rate, and combined activation at 7, 14 and 30 days --\nagainst a 70% benchmark line. Each divides its own activated\ncount by its OWN mature denominator.",
      "originalText": "Five series by signup week -- digital_activation_rate_7d,\nkit_sla_rate, and combined activation at 7, 14 and 30 days --\nagainst a 70% benchmark line. Each divides its own activated\ncount by its OWN mature denominator.",
