      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every published rate names the accounts it left out. This is\nthe table that keeps a maturity gate from being read as a\nperformance result -- it converts 'we excluded immature\naccounts' from a footnote into a number the reader can check.",
      "originalText": "Every published rate names the accounts it left out. This is\nthe table that keeps a maturity gate from being read as a\nperformance result -- it converts 'we excluded immature\naccounts' from a footnote into a number the reader can check.",
